      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In my world there is a jukebox player that is heavily reliant on the timer trigger to play the next song in the list, it is located to the right when you spawn. Since the timer triggers fire instantly it will keep hopping to the next song and looping infinitely.\n\nPosting this to make it easier to see this bug-report in action.\n\nhttps://www.vrchat.com/launch?worldId=wrld_a3415ca8-3bfc-4bd1-894b-2a62f9ac0ed9&ref=vrchat.com&instanceId=6081~hidden",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
